              "EZK.20.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani anini seera dansa intahinifi aada nama injirreesine worraa kenne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini aka worri ilmaani isaani ta angafa sorio baase akasiini ufi t'ureesu, iti lakise. Wonti anini akasi tolcheefi, aka worri gaargala argate, akasiini aka anini AABBO Waaqa beekhu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba amma, Namicha, waan atini worra Israelitini jettu, AABBO Waaqi guddaani waan jed'u, kunini kara d'ibi, ka abbootini teesani ta saala d'abde, naani arabsite. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini lafa duri worraa kakhad'e taanini d'umnaani, worri gaareeni d'ed'eertufi mukeeni dodoti lafa suni ch'ufa sorio iti qale. Worri sorio gubanifi daad'i d'ibaafatanini na dallansiise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini worra gaafad'e waan jed'eeni, Gaareeni d'ed'eertuuni isani sorio gubbati qaltani tunini maani? Tanaafi arti asi waan sunini Bamah jed'aniini, akasi jechaani gaareeni d'ed'eertu jechu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amma tana waan worra Israelitini jettu, AABBO Waaqi guddaani waan jed'u: Isani maafi ch'ubbuma abbootini teesani tolchite tolchitani, waan hamtu worri kad'ate kaani kad'atani ufi t'ureesitani? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arrale isani woma worri baase suni baaftani, waan harkaani boch'ani kad'atani ilmaani teesani gubdani, sorio baaftani, akanaani ufi t'ureesitani. Duuba isani worri Israeli, eegi waan kana ch'ufa taatani, amma d'uftani woi na gaafattani? Anini inkakhad'a, haga anini AABBO Waaqi guddaani jiru, isani itumaa deebitani woma na ingaafatani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isani waan jettani, Nu aka gosa d'ibi, ta lafa d'ibi keesa teete mukhaafi d'akha kad'atu tahu feena. Ammo wonti sunini isanii intaatu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Waaqi nama balleese namale jireesa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini inkakhad'a haga anini AABBO Waaqi guddaani jiru, aka anini isaniti dallane irreeni isani bulchu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini lafa isani iti firfirfamtani keesa wolti isani guure, dallansufi irre tiyya isani garsiisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini lafa aloo ta d'eebichaa ta gosa d'ibitini isani d'ufe, achiti diideese wollaala isaniti mure isani ch'eersa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini amma tana, akuma duri ababoota teesani lafa gamooji ta Sinai keesati wollaala iti mure, isanileti mura. Nami dubbi tana jed'e AABBO Waaqa gudda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini harka kiyya keesa isani keeyad'e, akasiini isani wold'aqisa kiyya guutani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini nama ch'ubbicha na didu ch'ufa isani keesaa fuud'e, lafa worri amma keesa jiru keesaa baase, lafa Israelileeti deebiu d'owa. Duuba akasiini aka anini AABBO Waaqa beetani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi guddaani waan jed'e, Amma tana isani worri Israeli waan mataani keesani maddu taha! Waaquma keesani ka harkaani boch'atani gula yaa! Ammo beekha, armaa achi isani ufumani daachatani na gula yaatani, deebitani waan harkaani boch'ani woi baaftani akasiini maqa kiyya qulqullo int'ureesitani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achiti isaani worri Israeli ch'ufti gaara kiyya d'eera qulqullo Israeli gubbati na kad'attani. Duuba aninileeni: huji teesani maache, sorioofi d'ibaayufi waan isani naa baaftani qulqullo ch'ufa isani iraa eegad'e isani iraa fud'ad'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eegi anini lafa isani iti firfirfamtani keesaa isani fuud'e, fulla tokoti wolti isani deebise, gochiti ch'ufti aka anini qulqullo hubati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hojja anini lafa Israeli ta ababoota teesani kakhad'eti isani galche aka anini AABBO Waaqa beetani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba isani akasiini, aka waan hamtu taatani ufi t'ureesitani qaabatani. Ammalle maro waan hamtu akasi suni taatanifi ufi jibbitani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yo anini gurra kiyya jed'e woi isani tolchu, isani worri Israeli aka anini AABBO Waaqa beetani; wonti akanatiifi anini waan sila isani gati wollaala keesani gula isani argachu maltani isani intolchu; Nami dubbi tana jed'e AABBO Waaqa gudda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ibida bitaa d'ufu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi na yaame waan nani jed'e, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namicha bita, millad'i, waan isii dubbad'i, badii badda isii fagi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan atini badda Negebutini jettu, waan AABBO Waaqi guddaani jed'u d'agayi. Laali, anini ibida mukha kanke gogafi jiid'ale ch'ufa gube balleesu siti kaya, ka nami dandae ind'aamfine. Ibidi sunini bitaa bahe, mirgati eje, owi isaa waan lafa suni jira ch'ufa guba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami ch'ufti aka anini, AABBO Waaqi, ibida nami dandae ind'aamfine badda suniti kaye, inarga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.48"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
